<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br><a href="www.RidgeLendingGroup.com "><font color="#3366ff">Please use the link included in Caeli Ridge's contact info</font>&nbsp;</a></b>below and complete the application. Caeli's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div>Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div><br></div></div><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(31, 73, 125);">C</span><span style="font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">aeli&nbsp;<span class="il">Ridge</span></span><span style="font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);"><span class="il">Ridge</span>&nbsp;Lending<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">10220 SW Greenburg Road, Suite 140</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">Portland, OR&nbsp; 97223<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">Toll Free 855-74-<span class="il">RIDGE</span>&nbsp;(74343)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">Direct&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="tel:(503)%20244-4161" value="+15032444161" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">503.244.4161</a></span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">Fax&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="tel:(503)%20821-7797" value="+15038217797" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">503.821.7797</a><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">e-mail&nbsp;&nbsp;<u><a href="mailto:cridge@ridgelendinggroup.com" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">cridge@ridgelendinggroup.com</a><u></u><u></u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">web&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<u><a href="http://www.ridgelendinggroup.com/" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=http://www.ridgelendinggroup.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1509480648048000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGQaHIHhIY6OILjPWlerLcnvyAVxQ" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">www.RidgeLendingGroup.com</a></u>&nbsp;<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Garamond, serif; color: rgb(68, 84, 106);">NMLS # 9556</span></p></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Rick</div><div><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bea0-baba97f6-16a5be29-baba97f6-00000004-akh1jtljgb2avjcra3athdno4hnubpbd&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1"><br></a></div><div><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/rick-luebbert-one-to-one" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/AZZsjERybkg9s9s_Czb0jjOLOG_dPKpGZbys3KhDRhmeaxH7H1aavMO2aIduqnagMDaG1RJ2M3d_exFGNPHC_OcRPpWsEWpIfww1wFB-V1lU-FCl